<section class="container g-pt-50">
  <div class="mb-5 mt-5">
    <h2 class="h3 g-color-black mb-0">Cookies & Policy</h2>
    <div class="d-inline-block g-width-50 g-height-1 g-bg-black"></div>
  </div>

    <!-- Product Description -->
    <div class="container">
    <div class="row g-mb-70">
        <div class="col-lg-12 col-md-12 col-sm-12">
            <div class="g-mt-30">
              <p>We use cookies on this marketplace to give you a smooth and personalized shopping experience. Cookies are small files that automatically get saved on your device when you visit our site.</p>
              <h5>Why do we use cookies?</h5>
              <ul>
                <li class="mb-1">To keep you logged in without asking you to sign in every time.</li>
                <li class="mb-1">To save the items in your cart, even if you haven’t checked out yet.</li>
                <li class="mb-1">To recommend products based on your interests and search history.</li>
                <li class="mb-1">To track how the site performs so we know what needs improvement.</li>
                <li class="">To remember your display preferences, like language or light/dark mode.</li>
              </ul>
              <p>We don’t use cookies to collect personal data without your permission. All the cookies we use are for functionality and improving your experience on our platform.</p>
              <p>If you’d prefer not to have certain cookies saved, you can manage them through your browser settings. Just keep in mind that some key features — like staying logged in or keeping items in your cart — might not work properly without cookies enabled.</p>
              <p>We may also work with third-party services (like Google Analytics or payment providers) that use their own cookies based on their own policies. If you have any questions or want to know more about this policy, feel free to reach out to our team through the contact page.</p>
              <h5>No Creepy Cookie Behavior</h5>
              <p>We don’t use cookies to spy on you or grab personal data without your consent. Everything collected is for system functionality and improving your experience — not for selling data.</p>
              <h5>How Long Cookies Stay</h5>
              <p>Each cookie has a different lifespan. Some are deleted as soon as you close your browser (session cookies), while others might last a few days or weeks depending on their function — for example, your shopping cart cookie may last up to 7 days.</p>
              <h5>You’re in Control</h5>
              <p>You’re always free to block, clear, or disable cookies via your browser settings. Just a heads-up: turning off cookies might cause some features (like staying logged in) to stop working properly.</p>
              <h5>How to Remove Cookies</h5>
              <p>You can delete or block cookies via your browser’s “Privacy” or “History” settings. Each browser is different, but the options are usually easy to find. If you’re not sure how, just look up a quick guide for your specific browser.</p>
              <h5>Updates to This Policy</h5>
              <p>We may update this cookie policy from time to time, especially when we add new features or if regulations change. For major updates, we’ll notify you through a site banner or by email (if you’re subscribed).</p>
              <h5>Cookies for Promotions & Discounts</h5>
              <p>Some cookies help us show you more relevant offers. For example, if you often check out fashion products, you might see special discounts tailored to your interests. It’s all to make your experience more personalized and helpful.</p>
              <h5>Children Under Legal Age</h5>
              <p>We don’t intentionally collect data from users under the legal age. If you’re a minor, please use the site with permission or under the supervision of a parent or guardian.</p>
              <h5>❓ Got Questions?</h5>
              <p>Still unsure about cookies or privacy settings? No worries — our support team is happy to help. Just reach out via the Contact Us page.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    </div>
    <!-- End Product Description -->
</section>
